ntifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ensembles\/coredataensembledelegate","role":"symbol","title":"CoreDataEnsembleDelegate","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CoreDataEnsembleDelegate","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"CoreDataEnsembleDelegate","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Ensembles/documentation/Ensembles/CoreDataEnsemble/ensembleIdentifier":{"url":"\/documentation\/ensembles\/coredataensemble\/ensembleidentifier","abstract":[{"text":"A global identifier for the ensemble, used to match corresponding ensembles across devices.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ensembleIdentifier","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"ensembleIdentifier","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CoreDataEnsemble\/ensembleIdentifier","type":"topic"},"doc://Ensembles/documentation/Ensembles/AttachingPhase":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AttachingPhase","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"AttachingPhase","url":"\/documentation\/ensembles\/attachingphase","identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/AttachingPhase","type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The phase of an attach operation currently in progress."}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AttachingPhase","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://Ensembles/documentation/Ensembles/CoreDataEnsemble/currentActivity":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The activity currently being undertaken, if any."}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"currentActivity","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:9Ensembles16EnsembleActivityO","text":"EnsembleActivity"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/document